<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/46/msa@/~cl_3> <https://schema.org/text> "Seksyen 51 Akta ibu dipinda dengan memasukkan selepas subseksyen (5) subseksyen yang berikut: \"(5A) Any director, officer or employee of the Bank or of a banking institution or other financial institution who contravenes section 30(1)(mmm) in respect of maintaining as secret any credit information disclosed by the Bank shall, on conviction, be liable to imprisonment for a term not exceeding three years or to a fine not exceeding five thousand ringgit or to both.\"."@ms <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/46/msa@> .
